WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
One proton. A moving scaffold.
Nine saved PBE images, not a time-resolved reaction.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Spend the labels differently.
36 shared configurations, then 24 additions per training branch.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
A striking original result.
The frozen original model pair is not a seed-robust causal estimate.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Then repeat the training.
Targeted wins both primary metrics in three of five paired seeds.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
A warning is not a force error.
Five coverage crossings coexist with small local PBE force errors.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Keep the boundary of the claim.
No independent deployment validation. The historical failure remains.
